<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I'd like to thank MrWrong for creating the ORIA format article (all his work, not a collab) and reviewing in the chat, SunnyClockwork for creating the amazing artwork in the third picture and reviewing in the chat, Metaphysician creating Sarkicism and reviewing in the chat, Decibelle, Minmin, Dr. Leonard, Vertigo and Habreno for reviewing in the chat, WrongJohnSilver for reviewing in the forums, and GreenWolf for help with image formatting.</p>
<p>The three photographs I used are free for reuse with attribution, and come from the following three sources:<br />
<a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Reconstructed_Babylon_-1.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Reconstructed_Babylon_-1.jpg</a><br />
